OL,4,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,5,     GJools shares his lifelong passion
OL,6,     Gfor classical music with
OL,7,     Gfascinating studio guests.
OL,8,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,9,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,10,     G1492. As seven centuries of
OL,11,     GMoorish rule comes to an end, one
OL,12,     GMuslim musician awaits a decision
OL,13,     Gfrom the new Catholic court. Will
OL,14,     Gthe music play on?
